---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Chungsiang Roeurn" showHeader={false}>
	<section class="page-shell">
		<a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to overview</a>
		<div class="header-box role-header-box">
			<p class="eyebrow">About me</p>
			<h1 class="section-title">Zero to Fullstack</h1>
			<p class="description">Developer building dependable products across web, APIs, desktop, and Telegram integrations.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="details-box mt-3">
			<p class="eyebrow">What I bring</p>
			<div class="about-pillars mt-8">
				<div><span class="eyebrow">01</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-medium">Product interfaces</h2><p class="description mt-3 text-sm leading-6">Responsive web and mobile experiences built with React, Next.js, TypeScript, and a careful eye for clear interaction.</p></div>
				<div><span class="eyebrow">02</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-medium">Connected systems</h2><p class="description mt-3 text-sm leading-6">Frontend work that connects cleanly to backend APIs, databases, Telegram Mini Apps, and real product workflows.</p></div>
				<div><span class="eyebrow">03</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-medium">Across platforms</h2><p class="description mt-3 text-sm leading-6">A practical path through web, mobile, backend, and current desktop application development.</p></div>
			</div>
			<div class="about-background mt-10 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-7 dark:border-neutral-800"><p class="eyebrow">Background</p><p class="description mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7">I studied Computer Science at the Royal University of Phnom Penh and began my professional path at dreamsLAB. Since then, I have worked across web, mobile, APIs, and product systems, with my current focus on frontend desktop development at VPS.Start Technology.</p></div>
			<div class="mt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-7 dark:border-neutral-800"><p class="eyebrow">Education</p><div class="about-education mt-4"><div><span class="education-index">01</span><div class="education-card-content"><strong>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</strong><span>Royal University of Phnom Penh</span><small>03-2023 — 03-2026 · Completed</small></div></div><div><span class="education-index">02</span><div class="education-card-content"><strong>Diploma of English Program</strong><span>Paññāsāstra University of Cambodia</span><small>02-2023 — 06-2024 · Completed</small></div></div></div></div>
			<div class="mt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-5 dark:border-neutral-800"><p class="eyebrow">Core stack</p><p class="meta mt-3">React · Next.js · TypeScript · Astro · React Native · GraphQL · PostgreSQL · MySQL · SQLite · C# · WPF</p></div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
